          "seriestitle": "Soundtrekkers",
          "description": "After the Soundtrekkers successfully record the gentle popping sound of water flowing through the Great Barrier Reef, they suddenly hear a loud CRACK! coming through their underwater mic. Oh no! It’s nefarious villain Show Tuna (the ocean’s most overly dramatic, compulsively performing theater nerd who disguises herself as a tuna and “speaks” exclusively in show tunes) breaking off pieces of the reef to use as set pieces for an upcoming show! When the Seven Cs Solver app suggests CREATIVITY as a solution, the Soundtrekkers come up with a clever way to save the reef and give Show Tuna the performance of a lifetime!",
